  <title>ModiRel: Edit and read INI and REL files</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>

<body>
  <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

Program to edit or read REL files or other type of file in INI format such as PAR, INI or INF files.
<P>
Example of the INI format:
<PRE>
[section]
Key=Value
...
</PRE>
<P>
In option 5, the command file format allows each of the program's possible actions, except 6, to be specified on one line of text. The INI file name must not be given, and all other parameters must be separated by a single space and enclosed in quotes if they contain spaces.
For example to change the name of a key, we can chain the following two actions:
<PRE>
1 Key Section2 "New Value"
2 Key Section
...
</PRE>
to get the INI file:
<PRE>
[Section]
Key2=New Value
...
</PRE>

<p>The program options are:</p>
